These terms grant no general permission to mirror, sell, redistribute, sublicense
or white-label NovaCore; publicly distribute modified NovaCore core/framework
material; rebrand it as another framework; or incorporate protected NovaCore
Material into another commercial game, framework, product or service. Where
NovaCore rights are needed, commercial framework exploitation and sublicensing
require separate written authorization from Licensor. No price, royalty, support
duty, automatic approval or entitlement to an agreement is implied.

These reservations concern protected material, not ownership of ideas or
independently created work. Rights independently supplied by law, third-party
licenses and applicable hosting-platform terms, including permitted on-platform
viewing and forking, are unaffected. A platform Fork button is not a grant from
this license of unrestricted off-platform redistribution.

6. Notices, identification and branding

Preserve applicable copyright and license notices when actually distributing
NovaCore Material under an authorized distribution permission. Ordinary independent
